{
  "note": "Seed for Brand.settings.planner of Therasbox (The Ras Box music promos). Built 2026-11-23 from the tags on its 45 ready assets (30 song-promo videos, 15 release posters). Posts 7 days a week, 09:00-21:00 America/New_York, all networks (Dean 261123). Settings only: posts per day per network are set on Review (0 = skipped). Loaded into DEV with: {\"action\":\"configure-planner-brand\",\"brandSlug\":\"therasbox\",\"settings\":<settings>,\"accounts\":[]}",
  "settings": {
    "version": 1,
    "pool": {
      "kinds": [
        "image",
        "video"
